  "body": "<!-- THESIS: Living connections should feel alive: learning and community have equal doors.\nOWN-WORLD: Original soil brown and forest with cooler taupe and sage surfaces; original type families; rounded photographic windows and tactile pill controls.\nSTORY: Look into the soil, see the people, follow curiosity, join the conversation.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: 72px left-hand headline and equal actions alongside a four-part 20-second film sequence, circular soil photograph and mycelium capsule.\nFORM: The user's pinned Cabana reference overrides the direction roll 38b50a19. Cabana image-in-type and rounded media; Organimo depth; Motion Primitives state transitions.\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md --><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"dock\"><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"dock-brand\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/5239bb98-logo-differtniated-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></a><span class=\"dock-rule\"></span><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a><a href=\"/common-ground/\">Forum</a><button aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"dock-menu\" type=\"button\">Explore <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M4 8h16M4 16h16\"></path></svg></button></nav>\n<dialog class=\"site-menu\" id=\"site-menu\"><div class=\"menu-top\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" lo