ading\"><h2>Something to read<br/>while you’re here.</h2><article class=\"resource-row filter-item\" data-category=\"baganihan-reports\" data-search=\"Issue No. 001 · Building Community Resilience Communities face rising uncertainty from climate, the economy, and global instability, yet the effects land locally. This first report is a guide to seeing change early, strengthening what a community already has, and deciding together through systems thinking and Community Continuity Management.\"><a class=\"resource-image\" href=\"/resources/baganihan/issue-001-community-resilience/\"><img alt=\"Issue No. 001 · Building Community Resilience\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1152\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5882ce02-community-garden-bd27781b08d8-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/5882ce02-community-garden-bd27781b08d8-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/5882ce02-community-garden-bd27781b08d8-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/5882ce02-community-garden-bd27781b08d8-928.webp 928w\" width=\"928\"/></a><div><span class=\"meta\">Baganihan Reports</span><h3><a href=\"/resources/baganihan/issue-001-community-resilience/\">Issue No. 001 · Building Community Resilience</a></h3><p>Communities face rising uncertainty from climate, the economy, and global instability, yet the effects land locally. This first report is a guide to seeing change early, strengthening what a community already has, and deciding together through systems thinking and Community Continuity Management.</p></div><a aria-label=\"Read Issue No. 001 · Building Community Resilience\" class=\"round-link\" href=\"/resources/baganihan/issue-001-community-resilience/\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"></path></s